timesheet for Debian
====================

The package installs the binary to /usr/bin/timesheet, the man page, and the
"Timesheet" menu entry and icon system-wide, so `timesheet install` is not
needed.

Do not run `timesheet uninstall` against this copy: it deletes the binary it
runs from, which here belongs to dpkg. `timesheet autostart` and
`timesheet autostart uninstall` still manage the per-user login hooks; remove
the package itself with apt.

